Subject: [PATCH] fix: stop server crash when a cursor move carries a link onto
 a full page (#5303)

* fix: stop server crash when a cursor move carries a link onto a full page

refs #5296

* fix: keep cursor link when a style page split moves the cursor

refs #5296

Refs: herdrdev/herdr#5303, herdrdev/herdr#5296
